1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,160
25 Nisan 1915, şafak.

2
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,310
Binlerce asker

3
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:05,610
Arıburnu'na çıkıyor.

4
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:06,890
Tepeler düşerse,

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,320
Çanakkale düşebilir.

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,860
Yarbay Mustafa Kemal'in

7
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,630
elinde bir alay var: 57.

8
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,120
Alay.

9
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,530
Ama yukarıdan henüz emir

10
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:14,070
gelmedi.

11
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,690
Sen olsan ne yapardın?

12
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,950
A: Emir gelene kadar

13
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:18,590
beklerim.

14
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,250
B: Emir beklemeden

15
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,670
alayla tepeye koşarım.
